In addition to the opening of the Hokuriku Shinkansen in the spring of 2023, in anticipation of the opening of the entire prefectural section of the Chubu Jukan Expressway, the extension and renovation of the prefectural dinosaur museum (Katsuyama City) and enhancement of its functions, the city wants to promote the shift from a day trip center to a stay-at-home-style sightseeing center, and to attract accommodation facilities.
It is a private idle land located next to the east side of the roadside station construction site.
Surrounded by Kuzuryu-gawa River, Takinami-gawa River and prefectural roads, it is more than twice the size of a roadside station (approximately twelve thousand square meters).
In the name of the development of an industrial complex, the Municipal Land Development Corporation has been engaged in land negotiations from this fiscal year, and the land will be created in the 21st fiscal year through land acquisitions.
According to the city, there have already been inquiries from private businesses such as farmhouse restaurants and harvesting experience facilities, fast food, and restaurants.
With regard to accommodation facilities, it was also revealed that Sekisui House is raising its name as a city to attract accommodation-specific hotels adjacent to roadside stations planned throughout the country.
