"We would like to promote the superiority of Katsuyama City by putting the Prefectural Dinosaur Museum and Skijam Katsuyama in the foreground," Deputy Mayor Mikio Mizukami said, "We will do our best to promote the superiority of Katsuyama City by putting the Prefectural Dinosaur Museum and Skijam Katsuyama in the fore."
