That’s the main reason why a super-individual YouTuber became a full-time employee
Ask the adopted president (bizSPA!
9/27 (Fri) 8:47 PM
He is now a hugely popular YouTuber with a focus on young people.
It’s not uncommon for companies to use them in advertising their own products, but there are companies that have started an unusual system called “YouTuber recruitment” that employs them as full-time employees in-house.
It is Direct Marketing Mix Co., Ltd. ("DmMiX"), whose main business is corporate CRM (customer relationship management).
What does it mean to “appropriate a YouTuber”?
We spoke with Mr. Yuki Kobayashi, the president of DmMiX, who is the president of DmMiX and also serves as the representative of the subsidiary staff first, where YouTubers were actually adopted this time.
I would like to support young people who work hard with YouTuber recruitment
In the first place, what kind of mechanism is "YouTuber recruitment"?
Yuuki Kobayashi (hereinafter referred to as "Kobayashi") : Nowadays, the profession as a YouTuber has become an aspiration of many young people.
Elementary school students are also at the top in the ranking of occupations they want to pursue in the future, and the number of young people they aim for in the future will continue to increase.
Until now, our company has recruited and supported young people who are chasing their dreams, such as bandmen and entertainers.
In the same way, "YouTuber recruitment" is to hire and support young people who are chasing the dream of becoming a YouTuber.
There is an image that when you are a YouTuber, there is an image in which individuals voluntarily post a video, but why did you decide to "adopt"?
Kobayashi: While many young people yearn for the profession of YouTube, there is a reality that most YouTubers can’t get the revenue they expected.
There are a lot of creators who work part-time while making and posting videos, and there are many creators whose families do not recognize the existence of YouTubers.
In this initiative, we will provide the selected creators with a salary and an environment for content creation.
At first, we would like to support our activities by supporting the demerits of the profession of YouTuber, which inevitably becomes an unstable position.
