At the very end, Klopp was asked a more self-congratulatory question: “When I congratulated the Bundesliga, I woke up on a certain bench and didn’t even know where I was. This time, I didn’t like to get drunk because I’m an obsessive about self-managing. The blessing of winning the CL was very modest. I remember it all. If I put everyone in front of me, I might be able to identify all the people I saw on the bus.”
