Three shinkin banks in Mie Prefecture ( Kuwana-Mie Shinkin Bank, Kita-Ise-Ueno Shinkin Bank and Kikuhoku Shinkin Bank) announced on the 26th that they had decided to reduce the withdrawal limit using a cash card in order to prevent the damage of special fraud.
For depositors over the age of seventy who have held a cash card of Kuwana-Mie, Kita-Ise-Ueno, and Ki-Kita shinkin banks and have never made a withdrawal transaction of more than a certain amount at an ATM for the past three-year-old.
